<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal PSBR falls in 1996.</title>
<headline>Portugal PSBR falls in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal's public sector borrowing requirement fell in 1996 to 542 billion escudos from 575.3 billion in 1995, the Bank of Portugal said in its latest monthly report.</p>
</text>
